   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>You’re right, added a comment. The easiest solution would be to encourage reward board members to use the same address they signed up for praise <img alt=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/wink.png?v=10\" title=\":wink:\"/></p>",
